  <data name="en_pano47_description"><![CDATA[From a distance of 800m one can hear the splashing sound of the fall. The moment you enter the gate leading to the falls, nature takes over as it present you with beautiful flora and fauna not typically expected of the Northern part of Nigeria.]]></data>






